## Interface: 16001
## Title: SwingTimerBuffTracking
## Notes: Tracks buffs whose remaining time is under a configurable threshold (seals, Slice and Dice, Enrage, or any longer buff once it's down to its last seconds; self-applied only by default), or buffs chosen by name via an allowlist, on a native Swing Timer bar (main-hand, off-hand, or ranged). A blocklist always excludes named buffs regardless of other settings. Each qualifying buff's icon slides right-to-left as it counts down; all qualifying buffs show at once. Works for any class.
## Author: Richard Bankhead
## Version: 4.3.0
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: SwingTimerBuffTrackingDB

